%N A398456 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} H(k) * H(2*k,2) / k^2, where H(k) = A001008(k)/A002805(k) is the k-th harmonic number, and H(k,2) = A007406(k)/A007407(k) is the k-th harmonic number of order 2.
%H A398456 Cornel Ioan Vălean, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-21262-8">More (Almost) Impossible Integrals, Sums, and Series</a>, Springer Cham, 2023. See section 4.43, p. 439, eq. (4.139), section 5.43, p. 466, section 6.43, pp. 700-705.
